    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009950/extras/24ac6bee6ac877397031f7c033730dcb.avif?t=1696185691\" /></div><br><br>With graphics harking back to the beautiful Japanese PC-98 pixelized novels and atmosphere that's a love letter to the PSP/NDS mystery games<br>Occult Rewrite is an erotic horror game that mixes the character-focused plot of a visual novel along with the investigation and puzzle solving elements of an adventure game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009950/extras/ee575a14660c6feb0f60caaad5c14fa7.avif?t=1696185691\" /></div> <br><br>When you and your classmates find yourselves lost in a mist shrouded island, you soon fall victim to a sinister malediction. &quot;Those who bear it will die at the strike of midnight&quot;, so says the Withering Curse. <br>As friends turn to enemies and clothes turn to underwear, you'll face all kinds of myths, legends and occult forces in your efforts to turn back the clock to solve the island's mystery.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009950/extras/4d16958a43fbe7100d4046a1c6133f8d.avif?t=1696185691\" /></div><br><br>In Occult Rewrite, you can't expect to enter-key your way to victory.<br>For gameplay we have several different mechanics such as <br>- Alternate Routes\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 - Puzzles<br>- Dialogue Choices\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0- Investigations<br>- Multiple Endings\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0- Logic Sections<br><br>And more!<br><br><i><strong>Acessibility!</strong></i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009950/extras/efb0b3c1b9a74c69ed49ac94b4ab9a78.webp?t=1696185691\" /></div><br><br>We also have a SFW/NSFW toggle in the options for streaming guideline compliance so you don't have to worry about strikes and/or people walking in on you!<br>(It's still not recommended to play Occult Rewrite in front of your parents)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009950/extras/a69d8026f518804ada09367d43a5408c.avif?t=1696185691\" /></div><br><br><i><strong>It's not &quot;Erotic Horror&quot; without the Fanservice!</strong></i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009950/extras/9f1655001aefd6b6552ffb2d6a60c7f1.avif?t=1696185691\" /></div><br>Occult Rewrite has over 70 unique CGs and 30 different scenes for every kind of taste. From a wholesome passionate kiss to a depraved [REDACTED] we've got it!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009950/extras/fd6e26d73f7db4c787d9efeeeb328606.poster.avif?t=1696185691\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009950/extras/fd6e26d73f7db4c787d9efeeeb328606.webm?t=1696185691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009950/extras/fd6e26d73f7db4c787d9efeeeb328606.mp4?t=1696185691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i><strong>It's not &quot;Erotic Horror&quot; without the Horror either!</strong></i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009950/extras/98aa859b33f5f63b4a60c740aa1ebd46.avif?t=1696185691\" /></div><br>Tactical Pants-shitting action! (Also, no jump scares, we know sudden hand movements can be dangerous when handling delicate parts.) Reaching your good ending won't be that easy, as the island is home to all kinds of folkloric creatures from all over the world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009950/extras/3f78c0fa6b6583a81a61d17c8d1c38dd.avif?t=1696185691\" /></div>",
